---
description: Test strategy rules
globs: "tests/**,src/tests/**"
alwaysApply: false
---

Read `architecture.testing`. External NYC APIs are mocked in automated tests. Test behavior/invariants rather than broad line coverage. Use real PostgreSQL integration environments for database semantics that depend on transactions, uniqueness, advisory locks, promotion, crash/retry or coverage publication. Keep real-data/BIS/10k work in acceptance tasks, not ordinary retries.
